# Frontend Guidelines

Rules for all frontend and UI-related code.

---

## Components
- Prefer Server Components
- Use Client Components only for forms, events, and browser APIs
- Components must be small and composable(use Atomic Design)

---

## Forms & Validation
- All forms must use react-hook-form
- Schema-based validation is mandatory
- Display loading, error, and empty states

---

## Data Fetching
- No direct API calls inside UI components
- Use abstractions/hooks for data access
- Handle error and retry states explicitly